    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about the oxalate thing but i read online that the antioxidants actually help protect the kidney cells from damage so it might counteract the stone risk. plus i'm already taking a lot of other stuff for my health so i feel like i can handle it. if i stick to like 2500mg, isnt that still considered a safe upper limit for most adults? i really just want to feel better without having to go to the doctors every single time i have a flare up.",
