      "content": "Self-managing a chronic condition like kidney stones with supplements is risky, as individual biochemical responses vary greatly. While antioxidants offer general health benefits, the interaction between high-dose Vitamin C and urinary oxalate metabolism requires medical supervision. Please consult your doctor before starting 2500mg, as your healthcare provider knows your specific stone composition and risk factors best.",
